      <title>SQL Server 迁到金仓，真正麻烦的不是数据，而是这些 T-SQL</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260904/SQL-Server-%E8%BF%81%E5%88%B0%E9%87%91%E4%BB%93%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E9%BA%BB%E7%83%A6%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E8%80%8C%E6%98%AF%E8%BF%99%E4%BA%9B-T-SQL/</link>
